    "long_instructions": "The <code style=\"background-color: #ececec; color: black; font-weight: bold;\">Painter</code> is supposed to paint a path to the house, but the program is not working as intended. Find and fix the errors in the program to help the <code style=\"background-color: #ececec; color: black; font-weight: bold;\">Painter</code> reach the house.\r\n\r\n<details style=\"background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;\">\r\n    <summary style=\"font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: bold;\">🔦 Need help? Review the problem solving process for tips.</summary>\r\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-left: 20px; margin-right: 20px;\">\r\n    \t<p>🔎 <strong>DEFINE:</strong> What is the program supposed to do? What is it currently doing? Rephrase the problem in your own words.</p>\r\n        <p>📝 <strong>PREPARE:</strong> Write out the steps you need to take to solve the problem.</p>\r\n        <p>🖥️ <strong>TRY:</strong> Change one piece of the code at a time. Write comments to document what you are trying and why. Test and run the program to check if this fixes the problem.</p>\r\n        <p>🤔 <strong>REFLECT:</strong> Compare the results to the problem to make sure you've solved all aspects of the problem. If not, revisit a previous step.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n## 🎯 Goal\r\n\r\n![](https://images.code.org/18be7dcc528b32d6bcfe1d0e1635e63a-image-1666298937923.gif)",
